---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="关于我们">
  <main class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero">
        <h1 class="about-title">关于中大飞跃手册</h1>
        <p class="about-subtitle">由中大学子自发维护的真实经验分享平台</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">
        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">我们是谁</h2>
          <div class="content-card">
            <p>中大飞跃手册是一个由中山大学在校学生和校友自发组建、维护的开放经验分享平台。我们相信：<strong>消除信息差，是帮助每一位中大人在关键节点做出更清晰选择的最有效方式。</strong></p>
            <p>这里没有官方宣传，没有机构营销——只有和你一样的中大人，写下的真实故事。</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">我们的使命</h2>
          <div class="mission-grid">
            <div class="mission-item">
              <span class="icon">🎯</span>
              <h3>消除信息差</h3>
              <p>让每一位中大人都能获取到真实、有用的学业规划信息</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-item">
              <span class="icon">🤝</span>
              <h3>经验传承</h3>
              <p>学长学姐走过的路、踩过的坑，就是后来者最好的参考</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-item">
              <span class="icon">🌱</span>
              <h3>共建互助</h3>
              <p>每个人都可以贡献自己的经验，让社区持续成长</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">覆盖方向</h2>
          <div class="directions-grid">
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">🔄</span>
              <h3>转专业</h3>
              <p>跨院系转专业经验、面试准备、学分转换指南</p>
            </div>
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">🎓</span>
              <h3>保研</h3>
              <p>推免资格、夏令营、材料准备全流程</p>
            </div>
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">📚</span>
              <h3>考研</h3>
              <p>院校选择、备考规划、复试调剂经验</p>
            </div>
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">✈️</span>
              <h3>出国留学</h3>
              <p>选校定位、语言考试、文书写作、申请时间线</p>
            </div>
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">💼</span>
              <h3>就业</h3>
              <p>校招准备、实习经验、面试技巧、行业选择</p>
            </div>
            <div class="direction-card">
              <span class="icon">💡</span>
              <h3>其他</h3>
              <p>大学生活规划、竞赛经验、考证指南等</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">开源与贡献</h2>
          <div class="content-card">
            <p>中大飞跃手册是一个完全开源的项目，代码托管在 GitHub 上。我们欢迎所有中大人参与贡献——无论是投稿经验文章、改进网站功能，还是修复一个错别字，每一份贡献都有价值。</p>
            <div class="action-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/cxw745/runaway745" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
                ⭐ GitHub 仓库
              </a>
              <a href="/submit" class="btn btn-secondary">
                📝 投稿分享
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">数据与影响力</h2>
          <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">10万+</span>
              <span class="label">累计阅读量</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">50+</span>
              <span class="label">真实经验文章</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">6</span>
              <span class="label">覆盖方向</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">开源</span>
              <span class="label">完全开放源码</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">致谢与友链</h2>
          <div class="content-card">
            <p>中大飞跃手册的诞生，离不开众多优秀开源项目的启发与鼓舞。正是这些先行者的无私分享，让我们相信：消除信息差的力量，可以改变一个人的选择轨迹。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="links-grid">
            <a href="https://csdiy.wiki/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-card">
              <span class="icon">🌍</span>
              <div class="info">
                <h3>CS 自学指南</h3>
                <p>计算机科学自学路线与课程推荐</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/qingyujean/awesome-gdufe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-card">
              <span class="icon">🎓</span>
              <div class="info">
                <h3>Awesome GDUFE</h3>
                <p>广财学习资源与经验整理</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="https://survivesjtu.github.io/SJTU-Application/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-card">
              <span class="icon">📘</span>
              <div class="info">
                <h3>交大生存手册</h3>
                <p>上海交通大学学生经验分享手册</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">开源手册友链</h2>
          <div class="content-card">
            <p>这里收录了其他高校的开源经验手册项目，它们同样在为消除信息差而努力。如果你也在做类似的事情，欢迎联系我们互换友链。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="friendlinks-grid">
            <a href="https://survivesjtu.github.io/SJTU-Application/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="friend-card">
              <span class="emoji">📘</span>
              <span class="name">交大生存手册</span>
              <span class="school">上海交通大学</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://pkuphoto.github.io/pkuphoto.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="friend-card">
              <span class="emoji">📸</span>
              <span class="name">北大生存手册</span>
              <span class="school">北京大学</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://csdiy.wiki/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="friend-card">
              <span class="emoji">🌍</span>
              <span class="name">CS 自学指南</span>
              <span class="school">计算机科学自学</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="friend-card">
              <span class="emoji">📰</span>
              <span class="name">阮一峰科技周刊</span>
              <span class="school">技术视野推荐</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="section-title">免责声明</h2>
          <div class="content-card disclaimer">
            <p>本平台所有文章内容仅代表作者个人观点和经验，不构成任何官方建议。每位同学的情况不同，请结合自身实际做出判断和选择。本平台不对任何因参考文章内容而产生的后果承担责任。</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 64px 0 80px;
    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .about-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    padding: 48px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light) 0%, transparent 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent);
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .content-card {
    padding: 32px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .content-card p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .content-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .content-card strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .action-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  /* Mission Grid */
  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .mission-item {
    padding: 32px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .mission-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .mission-item .icon {
    font-size: 40px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .mission-item h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .mission-item p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Directions Grid */
  .directions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .direction-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .direction-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .direction-card .icon {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .direction-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .direction-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Stats Grid */
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .stat-item {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .stat-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .stat-item .number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .stat-item .label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Links Grid */
  .links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .link-card .icon {
    font-size: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .link-card .info {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .link-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .link-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  /* Friend Links Grid */
  .friendlinks-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .friend-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .friend-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .friend-card .emoji {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .friend-card .name {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .friend-card .school {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .disclaimer {
    background-color: var(--accent-light);
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  /* Responsive Design - 只保留移动端适配 */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .directions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .friendlinks-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .directions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .friendlinks-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .action-links {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .action-links .btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .friendlinks-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .friend-card {
      flex-direction: row;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .friend-card .emoji {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      margin-right: 12px;
    }

    .friend-card .name {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
